    "sections": {
        "description": "The AI Machine Learning theme is designed for websites that present technology-focused content, data-driven projects, software solutions, research updates, and digital services. It includes structured layouts for showcasing case studies, service sections, team profiles, blog articles, and project information. The homepage supports organized content blocks, banners, feature highlights, and informational sections that can be adjusted through customization settings. The theme includes responsive page layouts that adapt across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices while maintaining content readability and navigation clarity. Built-in customization  options allow adjustments to typography, colors, headers, menus, and widget areas without direct code editing. It also supports integration with commonly used plugins for forms, SEO settings, galleries, and analytics tools. The layout structure focuses on organized presentation of technical content with balanced spacing and clear visual hierarchy. Additional features include blog templates, image support, social media integration, and customizable sections intended to support regular content updates and structured presentation of technology-related information across multiple pages."
    },
